ovel_title": "帝枕欢之最毒废妃", "content_zh": "第一 灭族之恨“好！那朕就成全你！”看着爱妃痛苦抚心的模样，商离天不再迟疑，一把夺过叶天明手中的宝剑，没有一丝犹豫，就那样刺进伍媚儿的心脏处！这一剑很快，快得甚至连一旁的人都没看清楚他是怎样刺进去的！他是练武之人，对人体各个部分都了若指掌，所以，不费炊灰之力，剑柄猛然一旋，转眼间，已将那颗还在怦怦跳动，还滴着鲜血的心拿到了手中。“呃！”胸口猛然传来的剧痛，伍辰儿痛呼一声，手下意识地捂住那空空的胸口，赤目的血慢慢地从她的指缝里溢出来，她不敢置地望着商离开，曾经那温柔多情的脸，此刻却变得如嗜血魔头一般狰狞可怕！“马上把它送到国师的炼丹房！”商离天看都未看她一眼，就把她的心交给一旁的太监，匆匆地送了出去。“商离天！你真的为了她而剜我的心！你好狠的心啊！”她怒视着他，那含泪的眼神从未有过的绝望，血不停地从她的胸口涌出来，如一朵妖娆的血莲花在她胸口慢慢绽放！原来，她只是他手中一颗用完及弃的棋子而已！传说，她的七窍玲珑心是天上神仙所赐，所以，就算失去了，也不会马上就死去！可是，这一刻，她多么希望自己已死去！失心之人不但活着，居然还能说话，在场的人都不禁变了脸色，叶子情更是吓得小脸惨白，直躲进商离天的怀里。“伍辰儿！别怪朕心狠！朕肯娶你，留你到今天，你应该感恩了，就凭你这样一个身败名裂的女人，也配嫁给朕吗？”商离天冷笑着，这也是他一直不碰她的原因。“哈哈哈～～”听了商离天的话，伍辰儿突然仰天狂笑起来，那笑声碎心裂肺，划破苍穹，响彻云霄：“商离天！我从来就没有身败名裂过！是你配不上我！”身体晃了晃，像是下一刻便要倒下，她那双狠戾的凤眼缓缓从他们身上划过，用尽最后的力气立下血咒：“灭族之恨，剜心之痛，不共戴天！若有来生，我必千倍奉还！”话说完，她缓缓倒了下去，尽管此刻她浑身都被鲜血染红了，可她那苍白的容颜依旧俏丽动人！商离天拥着吓傻了的叶子情回了寝宫，走时，他连看都未曾看已经死去的伍辰儿一眼！若兰心兰两名女官奉命为辰妃入殓，她们都曾受过辰妃的恩惠，对于她的死去，她们也很是难过。在替她清理的时候，心兰意外地将伍媚儿手臂上的一块类似人皮的东西擦了下来，赫然发现，那下面居然是一颗红得滴血的守宫砂！“若兰姐姐，你快看！”心兰指着那守宫砂惊道。“守宫砂？怎么可能？”若兰的脸也变了，朝伍辰儿礼了礼，说了声：“娘娘，冒犯了！”仔细检查一番后，两人惊得连嘴都合不拢来：被世人所不耻的辰妃娘娘，在嫁给皇上两年之后，居然还是完璧之身……宝贝们放心入坑，每天一更，一般都是在凌晨零点或是上午十点之前更新，若每天收藏涨二十以上，次日加一更", "source": "www.quanwenyuedu.io", "source_url": "https://www.quanwenyuedu.io/n/dizhenhuanzhizuidufeifei/3.html", "_fixed": true, "content_en": "The first hatred of genocide \"Okay! Then I will help you!\" Seeing his beloved concubine caressing her heart in pain, Shang Litian no longer hesitated, snatched the sword from Ye Tianming's hand, and without a trace of hesitation, stabbed Wu Meier's heart! The sword was so fast that even the people on the side didn't see clearly how it penetrated! He was a martial arts practitioner and knew every part of the human body well, so without any effort, he suddenly turned the hilt of the sword, and in the blink of an eye, he had the heart that was still beating and dripping with blood in his hand. \"Ugh!\" Wu Chen'er cried out in pain as a sudden sharp pain came from her chest. She subconsciously covered her empty chest with her hands. Blood slowly overflowed from her fingers. She didn't dare to watch Shang leave. Her once gentle and affectionate face had now become as ferocious and terrifying as a bloodthirsty demon! \"Send it to the master's alchemy room immediately!\" Shang Litian didn't even look at her, he handed her heart to the eunuch beside him and hurriedly sent it out. \"Shang Litian! You really tore out my heart for her! You are so cruel!\" She glared at him, her tearful eyes looked more desperate than ever before, and blood kept pouring out of her chest, like an enchanting blood lotus slowly blooming on her chest! It turns out that she is just a used and discarded chess piece in his hand! Legend has it that her exquisite heart with seven orifices was given by the gods in heaven, so even if she loses it, she will not die immediately! However, at this moment, how she wished she was dead! Not only was the heartbroken man alive, but he was also able to speak. Everyone present could not help but change their expressions. Ye Ziqing was so frightened that his face turned pale and he hid in Shang Litian's arms. \"Wu Chen'er! Don't blame me for being cruel! You should be grateful that I am willing to marry you and keep you until today. Do you, a woman with a ruined reputation like you, deserve to marry me?\" Shang Litian sneered, which is why he has never touched her. \"Hahaha~~\" After listening to Shang Litian's words, Wu Chen'er suddenly looked up to the sky and laughed wildly. The laughter was heartbreaking, pierced the sky, and resounded through the clouds: \"Shang Litian! I have never been ruined! You are not worthy of me!\" Her body shook, as if she was about to fall down in the next moment, her ruthless phoenixes Her eyes slowly passed over their bodies, and she used her last strength to cast a blood curse: \"The hatred of genocide and the pain of tearing out the heart are irreconcilable! If there is an afterlife, I will repay it a thousand times!\" After saying this, she slowly fell down. Although her whole body was stained red with blood at this moment, her pale face was still beautiful! Shang Litian hugged the frightened Ye Ziqing and returned to the palace. When he left, he didn't even look at the dead Wu Chen'er! Two female officials, Ruolan and Xinlan, were ordered to bury Concubine Chen. They had all been favored by Concubine Chen, and they were also very sad about her death. While cleaning her up, Xinlan accidentally wiped off a piece of human skin-like thing on Wu Meier's arm, and was shocked to find that there was actually a piece of gecko sand that was so red that it dripped blood! \"Sister Ruolan, look!\" Xinlan pointed at the guarding sand and exclaimed. \"Shou Gongsha? How is it possible?\" Ruolan's face also changed, she saluted Wu Chen'er and said: \"Empress, I'm offended!\" After careful inspection, the two of them were so shocked that they couldn't even close their mouths: Concubine Chen, who was shamed by the world, was still in perfect shape after two years of marrying the emperor... Baby, don't worry, it will be updated every day, usually before midnight or ten in the morning. If the daily collection increases by more than 20, one update will be added the next day.", "title_en": "Chapter 3"}